  <paragraph>We can extend the Product Property of Exponents to more than two factors.</paragraph>
  <example number="10.18">
    <problem>
      <paragraph>Simplify: $${x^{3} \cdot x^{4} \cdot x^{2}}.$$</paragraph>
    </problem>
